# Firebender Ascension counts a "whenever you attack" ability of a creature that attacked, as Isshin's rule reads "a creature attacking
# causes" (the rulings), and not one of a creature that stayed home. Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Ascension (its Soldier token) and Adeline,
# Resplendent Cathar ("Whenever you attack, for each opponent, create a 1/1 white Human creature token that's tapped and attacking").
# Turn 3 the Soldier attacks alone: its firebending counts, Adeline's trigger does not (one counter). Turn 5 Adeline and the Soldier attack:
# both count (three). Turn 7 Adeline attacks alone: the fourth counter copies her trigger, two Humans this attack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby x2
Black Lotus
Firebender Ascension
Adeline, Resplendent Cathar
Mountain x2
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

