Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Firebender Ascension.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Adeline, Resplendent Cathar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
